      "content": "It sounds like the loss of your identity has made the pain feel unbearable, but please know that your worth isn't tied to your athletic performance. The person you are still here, even if they feel distant, and there are ways to find meaning beyond your past self. You deserve support to help you navigate this transition, and reaching out to a counselor can provide the guidance you need during this difficult time.",
      "source": "target",
