    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's nothing else. \"finding meaning\" sounds so empty when the core of who i am is literally broken. it's like being told to find meaning in a house that's been burnt to the ground. if the essence of me is gone, why should i bother pretending this empty shell is enough? it just feels like a hollow, exhausting performance.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
